  "description": "Operating Area: Southern Andaman Seas (Phuket and Surroundings, Mu Ko Similan Marine Park, Phang Nga Bay and Krabi, Phi Phi Islands, Racha Islands, Koh Lipe and Butang Archipelago, Koh Samui, Koh Chang, Krabi National Park)\n\nDesigned by American Ed Tuttle, Maha Bhetra is a unique 90ft Thai-crafted wooden hull motor yacht that features three palatial double cabins below a spacious open-plan teak-laden saloon on the top deck. Its sturdy construction will take its guests far and wide in the Andaman.",
